    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"altering the future.\" that sounds like something in a movie. in reality, it just feels like a heavy, empty weight. like i'm just taking up space that doesn't need to be occupied. everything here is so indifferent to me. it's almost a relief to think about how little i actually matter to anything.",
